index 0000000..038bc87
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/wait-no-wait-and-callable-combine-bed32484f72a9eb6.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``wait=None``, ``wait=0`` and ``wait=sum([])`` mean "no wait" again, for
+    both ``Retrying`` and ``AsyncRetrying``. Previously they raised ``TypeError``
+    as soon as a retry happened.
+  - |
+    A plain callable can be added to a wait strategy with ``+``, for example
+    ``my_callable + wait_fixed(1)``. The result is a ``wait_combine`` that sums
+    both. Previously this raised ``TypeError``.
+  - |
+    ``wait_combine`` passes the retry state to its strategies positionally, so
+    plain callables may name their parameter anything.
